  'npr. K7M2QX ali Ana Novak': ["e.g. K7M2QX or Ana Novak", "z. B. K7M2QX oder Anna Müller", "es. K7M2QX o Anna Rossi", "npr. K7M2QX ili Ana Horvat"],
